    "solutionCode": "def findMin(nums):\n    left, right = 0, len(nums) - 1\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if nums[mid] > nums[right]:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid\n    return nums[left]\n"
